Frozen R reference for native marginal-sampler regression tests.

Source: h7nian/IntegMultiReg commit 67a59e2f8cae92cb5efc09656d7ee929216e58f1.
helpers.R, variance.R and coefficients.R are unchanged copies of the three
R/marginal-*.R implementations at that commit. The five data fixtures come
from that commit's .github/reference/fixtures. These files are test inputs,
not a second runtime implementation or an alternative public backend.

Keep the reference fixed. Compare complete output (including attributes) and
RNG state with identical(num.eq = FALSE); do not relax to a tolerance when
optimizing an existing algorithm. Independent posterior correctness checks
remain in .github/scripts/verify-joint-reference.R with marginal-bridge.R.
